# arc-agents cron entries
# Format: minute hour day month weekday
#
# Install (idempotent, marker-block upsert):
#   bun bin/cron-install.ts install bin/cron/health-monitor.cron
# Uninstall:  bun bin/cron-install.ts uninstall health-monitor

# health-monitor — every 5 min, probe the estate's long-running surfaces
# (auto-llm, v100, webui, discord, trading, ndivisible). Files ONE feedback row
# per down service carrying the DOWN transition; a sustained outage writes
# nothing and therefore alerts nothing; a recovery resolves the row and alerts
# once. Row id `hm-<service>` (webui /feedback) is both the dedupe key and the
# status summary. See bin/health-monitor.ts. Pinned PATH: cron has no `bun`.
*/5 * * * * PATH=$HOME/.bun/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin $HOME/.bun/bin/bun $HOME/repos/arc-agents/bin/health-monitor.ts >> $HOME/.cache/arc-health-monitor.log 2>&1